---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const path = '/disclaimer';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Important disclaimer about the nature of tarot readings on this site."
  path={path}
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p>
      All readings, interpretations, and content on Daily Tarot are provided for entertainment and
      self-reflection purposes only. They are not:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Medical, psychological, or psychiatric advice.</li>
      <li>Legal advice or representation.</li>
      <li>Financial, investment, or tax advice.</li>
      <li>Professional counseling of any kind.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      AI-generated interpretations reflect patterns in the cards and the prompt given. They are not
      predictions and should not be treated as deterministic.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you are facing a serious life decision, please consult a qualified professional in the relevant
      field.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
